0multiplicar%20tus%20ganancias.%3C/p%3E%3Cp%3ES%C3%ADmbolo%20Wild:%20Asimismo,%20durante%20la%20Fase%20de%20Bono%20de%20Tiradas,%20el%20s%C3%ADmbolo%20del%20pescador%20con%20la%20ca%C3%B1a%20tambi%C3%A9n%20puede%20ejercer%20de%20Wild%20y%20sustituir%20a%20los%20dem%C3%A1s%20s%C3%ADmbolos%20de%20los%20rodillos,%20de%20acuerdo%20con%20la%20Tabla%20de%20Pagos.%3C/p%3E%3Cp%3ELas%20Tiradas%20Gratis%20no%20se%20pueden%20activar%20dentro%20de%20la%20Fase%20de%20Bono%20de%20Tiradas%20Gratis.%3C/p%3E%3Cp%3ELas%20Tiradas%20Gratis%20contin%C3%BAan%20hasta%20jugarse%20todas%20las%20tiradas%20concedidas.%20Una%20vez%20acabadas,%20se%20te%20conceder%C3%A1n%20las%20ganancias%20acumuladas.%C2%A0%3C/p%3E%3Cp%3ELas%20Tiradas%20Gratis%20se%20juegan%20con%20el%20mismo%20n%C3%BAmero%20de%20l%C3%ADneas%20de%20apuesta%20y%20con%20la%20misma%20apuesta%20por%20l%C3%ADnea%20que%20en%20la%20tirada%20que%20activo%20las%20Tiradas%20Gratis.%3C/p%3E%3Cp%3E%3C/p%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cb%3E3%20Botes%20Progresivos%20%E2%80%93%20Jackpot%20King%3C/b%3E%3C/p%3E%3Cp%3EHaz%20coincidir%20cinco%20s%C3%ADmbolos%20de%20Jackpot%20King%20en%20una%20l%C3%ADnea%20de%20premio%20para%20acceder%20a%20la%20Fase%20del%20Jackpot%20Bonus.%3C/p%3E%3Cp%3EEl%20Jackpot%20King%20(Bote%20Progresivo)%20est%C3%A1%20disponible%20con%20cualquier%20apuesta.%3C/p%3E%3Cp%3EIr%C3%A1s%20a%20unos%20rodillos%20diferentes%20al%20juego%20inicial,%20vuelve%20a%20girarlos%20para%20acumular%20s%C3%ADmbolos%20de%20Coronas%20y%20ascender%20en%20la%20escalera%20de%20ganancias%20que%20ver%C3%A1s%20a%20la%20derecha%20de%20tu%20pantalla.%20Tras%20cada%20tirada%20podr%C3%A1s%20escoger%20un%20s%C3%ADmbolo%20que%20te%20conceder%C3%A1%20una%20nueva%20tirada%20%E2%80%9CSpin%E2%80%9D,%20un%20premio%20en%20met%C3%A1lico%20%E2%80%9CCollect%E2%80%9D;%20o%20acceder%20a%20la%20Wheel%20King%20(Rueda%20del%20Rey),%20cuando%20consigues%20m%C3%A1s%20de%2015%20Coronas.%20En%20caso%20de%20no%20alcanzar%20la%20Wheel%20King,%20se%20te%20conceder%C3%A1%20el%20premio%20de%20acuerdo%20con%20la%20posici%C3%B3n%20mostrada%20en%20la%20escalera%20de%20ganancias%20(cada%20posici%C3%B3n%20va%20asociada%20a%20un%20Multiplicador).%3C/p%3E%3Cp%3ELa%20Wheel%20King%20es%20una%20ruleta%20tipo%20t%C3%B3mbola%20en%20la%20que%20podr%C3%A1s%20obtener%20Multiplicadores%20sobre%20tu%20Apuesta%20Total%20o%20cualquiera%20de%20los%203%20Botes%20progresivos%20del%20juego%20(Real,%20Majestuoso%20o%20Jackpot%20King)%C2%A0%3C/p%3E%3Cp%3ENota:%20El%20Jackpot%20King%20s%C3%B3lo%20se%20puede%20ganar%20durante%20la%20parte%20del%20Bonus%20del%20Wheel%20King,%20dentro%20de%20la%20Fase%20del%20Jackpot%20Bonus.%3C/p%3E%3Cp%3ENos%20esforzamos%20por%20mostrar,%20en%20todo%20momento,%20el%20valor%20actual%20del%20Bote%20Progresivo.%20Pero%20esto%20no%20siempre%20es%20posible%20ya%20que%20pueden%20producirse%20demoras.%3C/p%3E%3Cp%3EEn%20caso%20extremadamente%20raros,%20el%20valor%20del%20Bote%20Progresivo%20obtenido%20podr%C3%ADa%20ser%20el%20inicial.%20Esto%20sucede%20cuando%20un%20jugador%20se%20lleva%20el%20Bote%20justo%20despu%C3%A9s%20de%20que%20otro%20lo%20haya%20hecho%20y%20el%20marcador%20del%20Bote%20no%20haya%20podido%20reiniciarse.%3C/p%3E%3Cp%3EPuedes%20ganar%20el%20Bote%20Progresivo%20jugando%20con%20cualquiera%20de%20las%20apuestas.%20Sin%20embargo,%20tus%20probabilidades%20de%20obtener%20el%20Bote%20Progresivo%20son%20proporcionales%20al%20valor%20de%20la%20Apuesta%20Total.%3C/p%3E%3Cp%3EEl%20porcentaje%20de%20tu/s%20apuesta/s%20que%20contribuye%20al%20Bote%20Progresivo%20es%20siempre%20de%202,32%20%,%20m%C3%A1s%200,68%20%%20al%20Bote%20Reserva,%20independientemente%20del%20valor%20de%20tu%20apuesta.%20La%20cantidad%20de%20Reserva%20se%20asigna%20a%20los%20tres%20Botes%20siguientes%20para%20que%20su%20cantidad%20de%20inicio%20no%20sea%20de%20cero.%C2%A0%3C/p%3E%3Cp%3ELos%20Botes%20Progresivos%20Real%20(Royal),%20Majestuoso%20(Regal)%20y%20Jackpot%20King%20de%20este%20juego%20son%20compartidos%20con%20todos%20los%20dem%C3%A1s%20juegos%20de%20Blueprint%20que%20tengan%20la%20funcionalidad%20de%20Jackpot%20King%20activa,%20en%20Boteman%C3%ADa%20y%20Canal%20Bingo.%20Los%20encontrar%C3%A1s%20al%20pie%20de%20la%20secci%C3%B3n%20Botes%20de%20la%20web,%20dentro%20del%20carrusel%20&quot;Jackpot%20King&quot;.%20En%20caso%20de%20caer%20alguno%20de%20los%20Botes%20Progresivos%20en%20alguno%20de%20los%20juegos%20descritos%20con%20anterioridad,%20el%20Bote%20Progresivo%20en%20cuesti%C3%B3n%20se%20reiniciar%C3%A1%20para%20todos%20esos%20juegos%20a%20la%20vez.%C2%A0%3C/p%3E%3Cp%3EUna%20vez%20adjudicado%20el%20Bote%20Progresivo,%20su%20nuevo%20valor%20se%20reinicia%20desde%20la%20cantidad%20de%20reserva%20obtenida%20y%20empieza%20a%20crecer%20a%20partir%20de%20esa%20cantidad.%C2%A0%3C/p%3E%3Cp%3ELas%20probabilidades%20de%20ganar%20un%20Bote%20crecen%20seg%C3%BAn%20el%20valor%20del%20Bote:%20los%20Botes%20Real%20y%20Majestuoso%20caen%20antes%20de%20alcanzar%20un%20valor%20concreto%20que%20se%20espec%C3%ADfica%20en%20la%20Tabla%20de%20Pagos.%3C/p%3E%3Cp%3ENo%20se%20puede%20ganar%20el%20Bote%20de%20manera%20simult%C3%A1nea.%20El%20Bote%20Progresivo%20solo%20se%20lo%20puede%20llevar%20un%20jugador,%20su%20valor%20nunca%20ser%C3%A1%20dividido%20entre%20varios%20jugadores%20a%20la%20vez.%20En%20caso%20de%20darse%20dos%20ganadores%20de%20un%20Bote%20a%20la%20vez,%20el%20jugador%20que%20antes%20active%20el%20Bote%20ser%C3%A1%20el%20que%20se%20lleve%20el%20Bote%20y%20el%20segundo%20jugador%20se%20llevar%C3%A1%20como%20m%C3%ADnimo%20el%20Bote%20Reserva.%3C/p%3E%3Cp%3EEn%20caso%20de%20problema%20t%C3%A9cnico%20o%20de%20p%C3%A9rdida%20de%20conexi%C3%B3n%20durante%20la%20ganancia%20del%20Bote%20Progresivo,%20este%20ser%C3%A1%20adjudicado%20igualmente.%3C/p%3E%3Cp%3EEn%20caso%20de%20problema%20t%C3%A9cnico%20o%20de%20p%C3%A9rdida%20de%20conexi%C3%B3n%20durante%20la%20partida,%20el%20dinero%20recaudado%20para%20el%20Bote%20Progresivo%20ir%C3%A1%20destinado%20al%20Bote%20Progresivo%20siempre%20y%20cuando%20no%20lo%20hayas%20obtenido%20en%20esa%20tirada%